Wishing for a wand of wishing doesn't work. (No surprise there). Silver 
or gray dragon scale mail are popular choices. Speed boots are good to. 
Another tip is to always ask for your stuff blessed and +2 or +3. (If 
you go higher than that you usually just end up with +0.) A blessed bag 
of holding is also very handy. The correct name for the item you 
mentioned is Amulet of Magical Breathing, and that's not a bad thing to 
have, but probably would be me choice.

